# AS7772-32X front-panel port LEDs: our own LED processor programs (led0.asm, led1.asm in this
# directory), generated by devices/edge-core-as7772-32x/led/build.sh with the OpenBCM SDK's ledasm.
# No port-order remap: the SDK's own (written by "init all") is the order the programs use.
# "led auto on": the SDK linkscan then keeps each port's link bit in the LED data RAM.
led 0 prog 02 20 67 44 02 24 67 44 02 28 67 44 02 2C 67 44 02 10 67 44 02 14 67 44 02 18 67 44 02 1C 67 44 02 30 67 44 02 34 67 44 02 38 67 44 02 3C 67 44 02 00 67 44 02 04 67 44 02 08 67 44 02 0C 67 44 86 F0 3A E0 32 0F 87 32 0E 87 32 0F 87 32 0E 87 67 5B 12 09 32 0E 87 91 74 54 57 12 A0 F8 15 1A 00 75 76 28 32 00 32 01 B7 97 75 72 16 F0 1A 02 71 76 32 0F 87 57 32 0E 87 57
led 0 start
led 1 prog 02 10 67 44 02 14 67 44 02 18 67 44 02 1C 67 44 02 20 67 44 02 24 67 44 02 28 67 44 02 2C 67 44 02 00 67 44 02 04 67 44 02 08 67 44 02 0C 67 44 02 30 67 44 02 34 67 44 02 38 67 44 02 3C 67 44 86 F0 3A E0 32 0F 87 32 0E 87 32 0F 87 32 0E 87 67 5B 12 09 32 0E 87 91 74 54 57 12 A0 F8 15 1A 00 75 76 28 32 00 32 01 B7 97 75 72 16 F0 1A 02 71 76 32 0F 87 57 32 0E 87 57
led 1 start
led auto on
